
@startuml 09_GameSessionService

title 9. GameSessionService - 한 판(게임 세션)의 전체 진행을 조율

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

enum GameSessionState {
  NotStarted
  InProgress
  Won
  Lost
}

class GameSession {
  - GameSessionId: Guid
  - LevelId: Guid
  - PlayerId: Guid
  - CurrentScore: int
  - ObjectiveProgress: int
  - ObjectiveTargetAmount: int
  - RemainingMoves: int
  - SessionState: GameSessionState
  - StarsEarned: int
  - CoinsEarned: int
  - SessionStartedAt: DateTime
  - SessionFinishedAt: DateTime
  + StartGame(): void
  + MakeMove(): void
  + IncreaseScore(pointsToAdd: int): void
  + AddObjectiveProgress(amountCollected: int): void
  + ActivateBoost(boostKind: BoostKind): bool
  + EndGame(): void
  + HasPlayerWon(): bool
}

class GameBoard {
  - GameBoardId: Guid
  - GameSessionId: Guid
  - RowCount: int
  - ColumnCount: int
  + SwapTwoTiles(firstTile: BoardTile, secondTile: BoardTile): bool
  + ClearMatchedTiles(): int
  + RefillEmptySpaces(): void
}

enum GemColor {
  Red
  Blue
  Yellow
  Green
  Purple
}

class BoardTile {
  - RowPosition: int
  - ColumnPosition: int
  - GemColor: GemColor
  - IsLocked: bool
  + CanBeMatched(): bool
}

interface GameSessionRepository {
  + FindSessionById(gameSessionId: Guid): Task<GameSession>
  + FindActiveSessionByPlayerId(playerId: Guid): Task<GameSession>
  + SaveSession(session: GameSession): Task
}

interface LevelRepository <<see 06_LevelService>> {
  + FindLevelById(levelId: Guid): Task<Level>
}

interface LevelService <<see 06_LevelService>> {
  + RecordLevelClearResult(levelId: Guid, finalScore: int, starsEarned: int): Result<Level, ServiceError>
}

interface GoldenKeyService <<see 04_GoldenKeyService>> {
  + RegisterLevelCleared(playerId: Guid): Result<GoldenKeyProgress, ServiceError>
}

interface PlayerService <<see 01_PlayerService>> {
  + EarnCoins(playerId: Guid, coinsToAdd: int): Result<Player, ServiceError>
}

interface PlayerBoostService <<see 08_PlayerBoostService>> {
  + ReserveBoostsForSession(playerId: Guid, selections: List<BoostSelectionForSession>): Result<List<PlayerBoostInventory>, ServiceError>
}

interface GameSessionService {
  + StartSession(playerId: Guid, levelId: Guid, boostSelections: List<BoostSelectionForSession>): Result<GameSession, ServiceError>
  + MakeMove(gameSessionId: Guid, fromTile: BoardTile, toTile: BoardTile): Result<GameSession, ServiceError>
  + FinishSession(gameSessionId: Guid): Result<GameSession, ServiceError>
}

class ServiceError <<see 00_CommonTypes>>

GameSession "1" -- "1" GameBoard
GameBoard "1" -- "*" BoardTile
BoardTile "1" -- "1" GemColor

GameSessionService ..> GameSessionRepository : Task<T> 결과를 기다림(await)
GameSessionService ..> LevelRepository : Task<T> 결과를 기다림(await)
GameSessionService ..> GameSession
GameSessionRepository ..> GameSession

' ---- Service끼리 서로 호출하는 관계(업무 오케스트레이션) ----
GameSessionService ..> LevelService : 승리 시, 클리어 결과 기록 >
GameSessionService ..> GoldenKeyService : 승리 시, 골든키 진행도 갱신 >
GameSessionService ..> PlayerService : 승리 시, 코인 지급 >
GameSessionService ..> PlayerBoostService : 시작 시, 부스트 차감 예약 >
GameSessionService ..> ServiceError : 실패 시 반환

note right of GameSessionService
  Repository는 절대로 다른 Repository를 호출해서
  "이 게임을 이기면 다른 4개 데이터를 함께 바꿔라"를
  표현할 수 없음. GameSessionService.FinishSession()이
  바로 그 역할을 함 - 형제 Service 3개를 순서대로 호출하고,
  각각의 Result<T, ServiceError>를 모아 최종 결과를 만듦.
end note

@enduml
